<h5 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:1:91">Give the gift of a good night's sleep.</h5>
<p style="text-align:center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:2:27"><a href="https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/522199/#!/donation/checkout" class="btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2">Donate Now</a></p>
<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:5:49"><h5 style="text-align:center;">Emergency Overnight Shelter</h5>

<p>
	<span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong>The Salvation Army Of Augusta's Center of Hope:</strong></span>
</p>

<ul>
	<li>Emergency Shelter (for single women and women with children): the line begins at 3:30 PM, and check-in begins at 4:00 PM until 7:00 PM. Dinner is at 5:00 PM. Check-out Is at 8:00 AM.</li>
	<li>Emergency Shelter (Men): the line starts at 3:30 PM. Check-in Is from 4:30 PM to 7:00 PM. Dinner at 4:30 PM. Check-out At 8:00 AM.</li>
	<li>Emergency Shelter (Family): the line begins at 3:30 PM, and check-in is at 4:00 PM. Dinner is at 5:00 PM.</li>
</ul>

<p>
	For more information, or to set up an appointment with a caseworker to find out more about our program, please call  <a href="tel:7068267933">(706)-826-7933</a> or fill out the form below.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/augusta/contact" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Request Homeless Service</a>
</p>

